title: The First Hello
id: intro
tab: The first hello
about: Broadcast fanfare introductions in turn, then the whole Studio 404 choir on the chorus
arrangement: introduction
lead: neon
key: D major
bpm: 116
bass: none
breath: .25

tune hello = 0 2 4 2 1 0 1 0/.75 | I 4, IV 4
tune reply = 0 1 2 4 3 2 1 0/.75 | V 4, I 4

[neon]
neon: "I'm Neon—two tubes in a box" = hello ; do nod ; take walk ; move left 3 ; cam two-shot
neon: "I hum twin notes around the clocks" = reply ; do cheer ; take alt-idle ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[cue]
cue: "I am Cue—I read ev'ry line" = hello ; do tilt ; take cast ; move right 3 ; cam two-shot
cue: "I turn my scroll so friends can shine" = reply ; do bow ; take letter ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[clank]
clank: "I am Clank—I boot up my screen" = hello ; do nod ; take clap ; move left 3 ; cam low-angle
clank: "Silver tape keeps my old frame clean" = reply ; do bow ; take bow ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[watt]
watt: "I am Watt—my red switch glows bright" = hello ; do cheer ; jump 1.5 ; move right 3 ; cam two-shot
watt: "Plug in with me and sing tonight" = reply ; do laugh ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[gruff]
gruff: "One string is plenty, nice and low" = hello ; do nod ; take toaster-shrug ; move wide-left 3 ; cam low-angle
gruff: "Hold this end tight and don’t let go" = reply ; do laugh ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[tabby]
tabby: "I am Tabby stitched from old cloth" = hello ; do tilt ; take walk-right ; move right 3 ; cam closeup
tabby: "My cracked screen purrs and keeps us warm" = reply ; do bow ; take toast ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[chip]
chip: "I am Chip—my floppy spins bright" = hello ; do cheer ; take action ; move left 3 ; cam closeup
chip: "Circuit crest gleams into the night" = reply ; do nod ; take stamp ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[zap]
zap: "I am Zap—I change the channel" = hello ; do gasp ; take turn ; move right 3 ; cam reaction
zap: "Every button means I'm sure" = reply ; do bow ; take walk-right ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[folio]
folio: "I read the words that cross my screen" = hello ; do nod ; take chuckle ; move right 3 ; cam closeup
folio: "My old scroll turns to start the scene" = reply ; do bow ; take belt ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[tracker]
tracker: "I am Tracker—wide ninety deck" = hello ; do tilt ; take drawer-lead ; move left 3 ; cam two-shot
tracker: "My tape door grins on ev'ry check" = reply ; do laugh ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[hertz]
hertz: "I am Hertz on channel oh four" = hello ; do nod ; take crt-answer ; move right 3 ; cam low-angle
hertz: "My rabbit ears catch ev'ry roar" = reply ; do cheer ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[ozzi]
ozzi: "I am Ozzi—prince of patch bays" = hello ; do cheer ; take biascheck-skit ; move left 3 ; cam low-angle
ozzi: "My purple specs ride green sine waves" = reply ; do laugh ; take audition-beats ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[deck]
deck: "I am Deck—I log zero four" = hello ; do nod ; take logging-clip ; move right 3 ; cam closeup
deck: "Press red record right on the floor" = reply ; do cheer ; take tape-jam ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[tally]
tally: "I am Tally—light burning red" = hello ; do gasp ; take ticker-cue ; move left 3 ; cam two-shot
tally: "My wood clip beak calls what you said" = reply ; do bow ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[clacker]
clacker: "Keys click clean on my olive chest" = hello ; do nod ; take performance ; move right 3 ; cam two-shot
clacker: "Four oh four keeps the beat all day" = reply ; do cheer ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[click]
click: "Quartz clock ticks on the suitcase snare" = hello ; do nod ; take performance ; move left 3 ; cam two-shot
click: "Tight downbeat never lets me slip" = reply ; do cheer ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[fuzz]
fuzz: "Twin warm tubes glow bright up on ten" = hello ; do cheer ; take shred ; move right 3 ; cam low-angle
fuzz: "Yardstick neck rings out loud again" = reply ; do bow ; take bow ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[latch]
latch: "Press my switch and the mic comes live" = hello ; do nod ; move left 3 ; cam closeup
latch: "One clean click gives the booth its cue" = reply ; do bow ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[leadsinger]
leadsinger: "Red deck spins in my open chest" = hello ; do cheer ; take performance ; move right 3 ; cam closeup
leadsinger: "Four oh four asks for one song more" = reply ; do bow ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[moonbell]
moonbell: "Soft pale glow fills the quiet night" = hello ; do tilt ; take reach ; move left 3 ; cam closeup
moonbell: "Golden bell rings above the floor" = reply ; do bow ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[thrum]
thrum: "Orange loop feeds back to my chest" = hello ; do nod ; take performance ; move right 3 ; cam low-angle
thrum: "Each warm echo comes back as Thrum" = reply ; do bow ; move center 3 ; cam wide
turnaround V 4

[chorus]
"We are the scraps that found a song" = hello ; do cheer ; dance 6 ; cam wide
"At four oh four we all belong" = reply ; do bow ; celebrate 4 ; cam wide
